// so runtime-fixed >= 2048 x 2176 x 4 = 17,825,792 bytes exactly. THE UPPER ENDPOINT is the
// composite floor under the same decomposition the checkpoint carry names: runtime-fixed (engine
// structures, allocator metadata) is a subset of the composite's non-checkpoint residue, and with
// the checkpoint residency unseparated the sound scalar upper is the composite floor itself.
// WHAT REMAINS OPEN, named: the full persistent-allocation census above the pinned buffer
// (sampler buffers, logits reservations, allocator metadata) is not derived in this corpus; a
