      " x buffer_width 2176 int32, allocated once at model init per glm5next/nvidia/model.py lines 588-606 at 8d09804c8) is persistent residency, so the lower endpoint is exactly 17,825,792 bytes (extdeps.vllm.sparse_prefill_transient term 3); the upper endpoint is this rank's residue -- the composite floor at ", r.host as String,
